abstract: >-
  EvoNAS is a Clean-Architecture AutoML and neural architecture search platform
  that continuously manages model lifecycle with Self-Adaptive Particle Swarm
  Optimization, closed-loop decision policies, continuous-learning recommendations,
  a metadata registry, FastAPI services, and a Streamlit operations dashboard.
  Version 1.0.0 includes a fair research benchmarking framework and Phase 12A
  experimental evidence on mock Sphere/Rastrigin landscapes.
keywords:
  - neural-architecture-search
  - auto-ml
  - particle-swarm-optimization
  - self-adaptive-pso
  - closed-loop
  - reproducibility
